# Contributing

Thanks for your interest in contributing to Azure Extended Zones community content.

## Where to start
- Questions / help: use GitHub Discussions
- Bugs / actionable work: open a GitHub Issue using the templates
- Doc improvements: open a Pull Request

## Pull request guidelines
- Keep PRs focused and small where possible
- Add/adjust docs under `/docs`
- Use clear titles and link to any related Discussion/Issue

## Code of conduct
This project follows the [Code of Conduct](CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md).
